00.0,"total_cash_per_share":19.179,"total_debt":3272999936.0,"debt_to_equity":37.969,"enterprise_value":18873589760.0,"enterprise_to_ebitda":8.975,"enterprise_to_revenue":0.689,"earnings_growth":0.942,"shares_outstanding":41012806.0,"float_shares":23436794.0,"held_pct_insiders":0.58185,"held_pct_institutions":0.22930999,"beta":0.325,"fifty_two_week_high":624.0,"fifty_two_week_low":332.0,"fifty_day_average":392.733,"two_hundred_day_avg":457.845,"target_high_price":632.0,"target_low_price":435.0,"target_mean_price":548.0714,"recommendation":"strong_buy","num_analyst_opinions":14,"all_time_high":977.6,"all_time_low":3.85,"long_business_summary":"Somany Ceramics Limited manufactures and sells ceramic tiles and related products in India. It offers ceramic wall and floor, polished vitrified, and glazed vitrified tiles; sanitaryware, such as toilets, basins, vanity cabinets, cisterns, urinals, and sanitaryware accessories; bath fittings, including faucets, showers, bath fitting accessories, allied products, and health faucets; smart bath ware products comprising sensor urinals, sensor faucets and toilets, and dispensers and sanitizers; water heaters; and adhesives, grouts, spacers, admixtures, tile cleaners, and waterproofing products. The company provides its products under the Somany brand name. It also exports its products. The company was incorporated in 1968 and is headquartered in Noida, India."}}